#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Figure 2. Key Exchange Protocol](/learning/images/courses/quantum-safe-"
"cryptography/asymmetric-key-cryptography/kep_akc.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Figura 2. Protocollo di scambio di "
"chiavi](/learning/images/courses/quantum-safe-cryptography/asymmetric-key-"
"cryptography/kep_akc.svg)\n"

